DUALIZE(C):
  if C is Var(i): return Var(i)
  if C is Const(c): return Const(-c)
  if C is Add(A, B): return Add(DUALIZE(A), DUALIZE(B))
  if C is Min(A, B): return Max(DUALIZE(A), DUALIZE(B))
  if C is Max(A, B): return Min(DUALIZE(A), DUALIZE(B))

Complexity: O(|C|) time, O(|C|) space

